{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Of_A9TaZ8Lngiet5WYDJkg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:21.093491+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Of_A9TaZ8Lngiet5WYDJkg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为了促进高校优秀大学生之间的学术交流，加强青年学生对哈尔滨工业大学环境学院的了解，哈尔滨工业大学环境学院将于</span><strong><span>2025年7月3日-7月7日</span></strong><span>举办夏令营活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65PsBa2iaN0TmPPS43HD2PItszNKEOLhYrOJ6zCLuNbm8lx8UBDib5ibmlw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营主要招募能够在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生（简称推免生）资格，拟申请到哈尔滨工业大学环境学院攻读研究生（含直博生）的2026年优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学习成绩优秀，来自一流高校或本科前3年（或前5学期）综合成绩排名在学校同年级</span><strong><span>专业前10%之内</span></strong><span>的推免生优先考虑（如在学术研究、学科竞赛、创新发明等某一方面表现特别优秀，也可申报，并提交详实的证明材料）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>政治思想品德合格、身心健康，对环境科学与工程、资源与环境、土木工程（市政工程）、土木水利（市政工程）、微生物学等相关学科有浓厚兴趣，有志于相应的研究应用工作，并有较强的学术能力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>英语四级及以上。</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65vLicrxQgEVUmJGvQZwA2DWHbTux2ZdtLlgMo2RkPU3NvBvmqsDR7jVA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2024年优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营合影</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65AoAia60j0WTx3kSIaNKria2AoNUBp0jiacu5LLKnsmwObEBpzuaQbEycQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span> TECHNOLOGY</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65M4qiaCoSb5mG3OQFziaUjcIg3coQY4ZEyuXI3lqF3TSVOLH4ZJC2K4Yw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>1、入营申请采取网上报名和电子邮件方式，登录哈尔滨工业大学研究生招生网官方网站夏令营报名系统直接报名：http://hityzb.hit.edu.cn/zhxy-yjs-zs_v2/pc/xly/index</span></p><p><span>（注：请拷贝上面链接到浏览器后登录）。</span></p><p><span>入选夏令营的同学请扫二维码加入哈尔滨工业大学环境学院暑期夏令营QQ群，</span><strong><span>群号：862352859</span></strong><span>（申请进群请修改备注为：本科院校+姓名）。</span></p><p><span>2、报名起止时间：</span><strong><span>5月7日—6月7日</span></strong></p><p><span>3、申请材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单（或官网截图）；</span></p><p><span>（2）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的前五或六个学期的成绩排名证明（格式见</span><strong><span>附件1</span></strong><span>，要求网上报名填报的专业排名应与成绩单（或专业排名证明）上的排名一致)；</span></p><p><span>（3）体现英语水平的证明材料（国家英语四、六级，TOEFL成绩，GRE/GMAT成绩等）；</span></p><p><span>（4）专家书面推荐信2份（副教授及以上），格式自定；</span></p><p><span>（5）其他证明材料，包括专本科期间各类获奖证书复印件等。</span></p><p><span>请将</span><strong><span>附件2</span></strong><span>报名表及以上材料扫描并合并成一个PDF文件，</span><strong><span>6月7日</span></strong><span>前上传至报名系统并发送至邮箱：hitenv1301@163.com，标题和文件名为“本科院校+姓名+预报名学科”。</span></p><p><span><span>如果有意向导师可以填报，学生在系统报名时请务必在备注栏注明预报名的学科（环境科学与工程、资源与环境、微生物学、土木工程（市政工程）、土木水利（市政工程））。</span></span></p></section><section><p><span>确定名单：环境学院招生工作领导小组根据申请者的网上报名信息，重点考察申请者学业水平、科研能力和综合素质，确定入选者名单。入选者名单将于</span><strong><span>6月15日前</span></strong><span>通过网报系统和邮件形式进行通知。届时未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65hoGQwK72DKjBKqfxJibBDdWCiatrqricfk2q1OJdgpk2rXXxQH6cHRJ1A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2024年优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营合影</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65AoAia60j0WTx3kSIaNKria2AoNUBp0jiacu5LLKnsmwObEBpzuaQbEycQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65PsBa2iaN0TmPPS43HD2PItszNKEOLhYrOJ6zCLuNbm8lx8UBDib5ibmlw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报到时间:</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>7月3日，活动时间：7月3日—7日（暂定）</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报到地点:</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>哈尔滨工业大学二校区环境学院三楼会议室（具体地点、日程QQ群内另行通知）。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容:</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（1）夏令营开营式，介绍学校与学院基本情况和相关研究生政策；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）学科前沿学术报告、学院学生活动介绍、学生座谈；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）体验哈尔滨文化、哈工大校园文化，参观国家重点实验室、航天馆、博物馆等；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）营员进行学术交流。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q650jplGdxHccBGvXU4TbKrgOOibB2p9QZLIXibrM5g3WAlzJWAiajUZawWA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2024年优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营合影</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65AoAia60j0WTx3kSIaNKria2AoNUBp0jiacu5LLKnsmwObEBpzuaQbEycQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span> TECHNOLOGY</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65M4qiaCoSb5mG3OQFziaUjcIg3coQY4ZEyuXI3lqF3TSVOLH4ZJC2K4Yw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院将为营员提供夏令营期间在哈尔滨的食宿及相关活动的资助，学术交流表现优秀的异地学校学生报销哈市至学生本科学校往返硬座火车票费用（需出示票根报销）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营的活动。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>具体日程根据实际情况进行调整，并另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>具体接收政策以学校的文件为准。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65jS0C2tM7b5YvRsibPgGZ9A7YRiczDibcmzibOgl7gyicUC6FNHAwneZLicgA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>2024年优秀研究生生源选拔暑期夏令营学生签到</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65AoAia60j0WTx3kSIaNKria2AoNUBp0jiacu5LLKnsmwObEBpzuaQbEycQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span> TECHNOLOGY</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65M4qiaCoSb5mG3OQFziaUjcIg3coQY4ZEyuXI3lqF3TSVOLH4ZJC2K4Yw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>联系人：席丹丹</span></p><p><span>联系方式：0451-86283006</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：hitenv1301@163.com</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65AoAia60j0WTx3kSIaNKria2AoNUBp0jiacu5LLKnsmwObEBpzuaQbEycQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Of_A9TaZ8Lngiet5WYDJkg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：成绩排名证明模板.docx</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Of_A9TaZ8Lngiet5WYDJkg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：报名表.docx</a></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icMhJVo6CWWUvvcJXMgjickyZPH2oo0Q65rW1yugfDcNeg5sj4iaeLol17KMslctmTtkxIuqOXyTF4SovC17YZYuw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>编辑 | 马秉正</span></span></p><p><span>初审 | 金利橦</span></p><p><span>复审 | 于虹霞  魏亮亮</span></p><p><span>终审 | 张鑫平</span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"727a2a18f6cd09c7bc35eb28821895c35e42116a57e0ad40e38ebe0105a82067","textLength":1606,"sourceSha256":"993aaabccbc3dec0e53857eb9d4dc72920798abf7651c656ce949f8a3bac0228","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-918d562102fb2a49cb1a","title":"2025年哈尔滨工业大学环境学院2025年夏令营第二轮通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-1